{"id":"c4a4d86afe645047","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-borel-space-properties.md","title":"Borel Space Properties","display":"thm-borel-space-properties — Borel Space Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-borel-space-properties","aliases":["58-thm-borel-space-properties"],"display":"thm-borel-space-properties — Borel Space Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-borel-space]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-polish-space]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-borel-space-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-borel-space-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-borel-space-properties — Borel Space Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbddaeec1a020d3b\" href=\"?note=bbddaeec1a020d3b\" title=\"58-df-borel-space\">58-df-borel-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space\">58-df-polish-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\tau_\\times,\\mathcal B_X,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B_\\times,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\tau_\\times,\\mathcal B_X,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B_\\times,f\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span> are the exact predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}space\\text{-}properties}\\vdash \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\rangle,X\\times Y,\\tau_\\times)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B_\\times)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X\\times Y,\\tau_\\times,\\mathcal B_\\times)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}borel\\text{-}space\\text{-}properties}\\vdash \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{Polish}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\rangle,X\\times Y,\\tau_\\times)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\mathcal B_\\times)\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X\\times Y,\\tau_\\times,\\mathcal B_\\times)\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For Polish spaces, the product sigma algebra is identified through the sourced three-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\\)</span> predicate, rather than an undeclared sigma-generation operator. Every continuous map is consequently Borel measurable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-borel-space","status":"resolved","id":"bbddaeec1a020d3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea